          <div class="fc-hero-copy">
            <p class="fc-eyebrow">A classroom for computational ideas</p>
            <h1>Turn a mathematical idea into <em>working code.</em></h1>
            <p class="fc-lead">Give every learner a private GitHub repository, useful test feedback, and room to try again. A free, self-hosted alternative to GitHub Classroom, built around small programming exercises.</p>
            <p class="fc-actions"><a class="fc-button fc-primary" href="https://github.com/finmath/finmath-classroom/blob/main/GETTING_STARTED.md">Try it locally <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="fc-button fc-secondary" href="demo.html">Follow a learner <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></p>
            <p class="fc-stack">Java 17+ <span>·</span> Maven <span>·</span> JUnit <span>·</span> SQLite</p>
          </div>
