            <div class="fc-window-bar"><span class="fc-window-dots" aria-hidden="true">● ● ●</span><span>NUMERICAL METHODS / LAB 01</span></div>
            <div class="fc-preview-body">
              <p class="fc-eyebrow">The learning loop</p>
              <h2>Make a change.<br />See what happens.</h2>
              <div class="fc-preview-identity"><span class="fc-avatar" aria-hidden="true">AS</span><p><strong>Alex Student</strong><br /><span>Fictional learner · alex-student</span></p><span class="fc-badge fc-badge-neutral">Private repo</span></div>
